      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℣. O Lord, open Thou my lips.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            513
          ],
          "translation": {
            "kind": "source-English",
            "sourcePages": [
              513
            ]
          },
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0001",
          "verification": "visual-review"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℟. And my mouth shall declare Thy praise.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            513
          ],
          "translation": {
            "kind": "source-English",
            "sourcePages": [
              513
            ]
          },
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0002",
          "verification": "visual-review"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℣. Incline unto my aid, O God.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            513
          ],
          "translation": {
            "kind": "source-English",
            "sourcePages": [
              513
            ]
          },
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0003",
          "verification": "visual-review"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℟. O Lord, make haste to help me. Glory be to the Father, etc.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            513
          ],
          "translation": {
            "kind": "source-English",
            "sourcePages": [
              513
            ]
          },
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0004",
          "verification": "visual-review"
        },
        {
          "type": "rubric",
          "source": "Hymn",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            513
          ],
          "translation": {
            "kind": "source-English",
            "sourcePages": [
              513
            ]
          },
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0005",
          "verification": "visual-review"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Dear Spouse of Virgins, hear us sing With joy a virgin’s praise, Whom Thou didst in Thy love prepare To join angelic lays.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            513
          ],
          "translation": {
            "kind": "source-English",
            "sourcePages": [
              513
            ]
          },
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0006",
          "verification": "visual-review"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "And hear us, too, O Gertrude, now, While we thy joys proclaim, Chanting this office with sweet voice, In honour of thy name.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            513
          ],
          "translation": {
            "kind": "source-English",
            "sourcePages": [
              513
            ]
          },
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0007",
          "verification": "visual-review"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Praise be to Father, and to Son, And to the Paraclete, By whom this spouse unto her Lord Was joined in union sweet.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            513
          ],
          "translation": {
            "kind": "source-English",
            "sourcePages": [
              513
            ]
          },
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0008",
          "verification": "visual-review"
        },
        {
          "type": "rubric",
          "source": "Prayer",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            513
          ],
          "translation": {
            "kind": "source-English",
            "sourcePages": [
              513
            ]
          },
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0009",
          "verification": "visual-review"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "O God, who didst delight to dwell In the most pure heart of the blessed Gertrude, Purify our hearts by her merits and intercession, That they may become a habitation worthy Of Thy Divine Majesty: Who livest and reignest with Thee, In the unity of the Holy Ghost, World without end. Amen.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            513
          ],
          "translation": {
            "kind": "source-English",
            "sourcePages": [
              513
            ]
          },
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0010",
          "verification": "visual-review"
        }
      ]
    },
